package(USEPKG G4GeoLoki LOKI LokiMasking G4Interfaces G4Launcher G4CustomPyGen GriffAnaUtils GriffB10Common SimpleHists Units USEEXT MCPL)

######################################################################

Package providing the geometries, simulation and analysis scripts of the tests of
the LOKI rear detector bank at the Larmor instrument (ISIS) in 2020 and 2022.

The Larmor setups are frozen: they keep their own copy of the bank placement and
of the tube and pixel numbering (Larmor2022Bank), so that changes of the LOKI
geometry do not change them. The detector hardware (tubes, packs, the rear bank
box and its masks) comes from G4GeoLoki.

Primary author: milan.klausz@ess.eu
